From: Takoserver Native source candidate
Subject: [SOURCE ONLY v6.12] join actual original owner destruction through owned completion

Apply after formal18. A separate refcounted file/heap-owner anchor survives
both original file close and actual last-owner destruction. BEGIN hands off
only the original file owner ref after CUT/ref-release guards; READ polls the
real post-kfree completion without mutation or consuming the event.
This proves tracked-owner destruction only, not all-flow/terminal/Core removal.
Existing sticky poison, CREATE one-use, namespace release and net_free stay.

